  "task": {
    "task_id": "TASK-20261104-01",
    "title": "订单查询支持金额区间筛选",
    "description": "订单列表页需要按金额区间筛选订单。请按 REQ-ORD-014 实现金额区间筛选，并保证 REQ-ORD-002、REQ-ORD-003 规定的排序与分页行为不变；既有状态/客户筛选与未知字段兼容性（REQ-ORD-001、REQ-ORD-004）必须保持。",
    "modules": [
      "order-query"
    ],
    "repo": "demo_project"
  },
  "specs": [
    {
      "id": "REQ-ORD-004",
      "title": "未知字段向后兼容",
      "kind": "requirement",
      "status": "active",
      "module": "order-query",
      "tags": [
        "compatibility",
        "contract",
        "payload"
      ],
      "applies_to": [
        "ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search"
      ],
      "verified_by": [
        "tests/test_search_basic.py"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": "",
      "affects": [],
      "body": "请求体中未定义的字段必须被忽略，不得因此返回 4xx。该规则保证旧客户端在服务端新增筛选项后仍然可用；\n新增筛选项本身不得放宽本规则。",
      "source": "specs/order-query.md#L41",
      "revision": "7b2b32ae4d1ae075e290058af81173c70ca585b49144eaa4c840d8c52585c618"
    },
    {
      "id": "REQ-ORD-014",
      "title": "订单金额区间筛选",
      "kind": "requirement",
      "status": "active",
      "module": "order-query",
      "tags": [
        "amount",
        "range",
        "filter",
        "decimal",
        "currency"
      ],
      "applies_to": [
        "ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search"
      ],
      "verified_by": [
        "tests/test_amount_filter.py",
        "tests/test_amount_validation.py"
      ],
      "supersedes": [
        "REQ-ORD-009"
      ],
      "superseded_by": "",
      "affects": [],
      "body": "请求体新增三个可选字段：`amount_min`、`amount_max`、`currency`。\n\n1. `amount_min` 与 `amount_max` 为十进制字符串，使用 `decimal.Decimal` 做精确数值比较，禁止转换为\n   `float`；区间为闭区间 `[amount_min, amount_max]`，上下界都必须能命中。\n2. 只给出其中一个边界时按单侧区间处理；两个边界都不给时金额区间不参与过滤。\n3. 任一金额边界出现（非空字符串）时，必须显式提供 `currency`，否则返回\n   `400 CURRENCY_REQUIRED`。不得为缺失的币种假定默认值。\n4. `currency` 单独出现时也必须生效，只返回币种完全相同的订单。\n5. 金额格式只允许 `^[0-9]{1,12}(\\.[0-9]{1,6})?$`；千分位、科学计数法、负号、币种符号、其他字符\n   一律返回 `400 INVALID_AMOUNT`。空字符串与纯空白视为未提供。\n6. `amount_min > amount_max` 返回 `400 INVALID_RANGE`；两者相等时按精确金额匹配。\n7. 金额筛选必须与其他筛选条件、排序契约（REQ-ORD-002）和分页契约（REQ-ORD-003）组合生效，\n   `total` 仍为全部过滤条件生效后的总数。",
      "source": "specs/order-query.md#L63",
      "revision": "f0dbb3b16992b0239f75d851c8f35aefeca2f7f3ca376866744a41bf753ea8ec"
    },
    {
      "id": "REQ-ORD-002",
      "title": "结果排序契约",
      "kind": "requirement",
      "status": "active",
      "module": "order-query",
      "tags": [
        "ordering",
        "sort",
        "stable"
      ],
      "applies_to": [
        "ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search"
      ],
      "verified_by": [
        "tests/test_search_basic.py"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": "",
      "affects": [],
      "body": "结果必须先按 `created_at` 倒序排列；`created_at` 相同的订单按 `order_id` 升序排列。\n排序必须在分页切片之前完成，任何新增筛选条件都不得改变该排序契约。",
      "source": "specs/order-query.md#L18",
      "revision": "38330c79404c06332ca576eddf6417727b5d8659a3b4a2e511a76d3e0826b4d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "REQ-ORD-001",
      "title": "状态与客户筛选",
      "kind": "requirement",
      "status": "active",
      "module": "order-query",
      "tags": [
