      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": "",
      "affects": [],
      "body": "`status` 与 `customer_id` 可以单独使用，也可以组合使用，语义为逻辑与。\n`status` 只接受 `pending`、`paid`、`shipped`、`cancelled`、`refunded`，其他取值返回\n`400 INVALID_STATUS`。空字符串与纯空白视为未提供该筛选条件，不参与过滤。",
      "source": "specs/order-query.md#L6",
      "revision": "1b73c8ca9a7c873ec160671640a58982991966a1470a7906623fc579d0c421d8"
    },
    {
      "id": "REQ-ORD-016",
      "title": "金额筛选的验证要求",
      "kind": "requirement",
      "status": "active",
      "module": "order-query",
      "tags": [
        "verification",
