      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": "",
      "affects": [],
      "body": "可预期的入参错误必须返回 HTTP 400 与统一错误体：\n\n```json\n{\"error\": {\"code\": \"<ERROR_CODE>\", \"message\": \"<可读说明>\"}}\n```\n\n`code` 取值受控：`INVALID_REQUEST`、`INVALID_STATUS`、`INVALID_PAGE`、`INVALID_PAGE_SIZE`、\n`CURRENCY_REQUIRED`、`INVALID_AMOUNT`、`INVALID_RANGE`。`message` 面向调用方，不得包含堆栈或内部路径。",
      "source": "specs/api-contract.md#L3",
      "revision": "7a744a82631046668fbb0e64d8fff2ffc15c50212a7895a1b4b274981e3ea6f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "REQ-ORD-003",
      "title": "分页契约",
      "kind": "requirement",
      "status": "active",
      "module": "order-query",
      "tags": [
        "pagination",
        "page",
        "total"
      ],
      "applies_to": [
        "ledgerflow.service.OrderQueryService.search"
      ],
      "verified_by": [
        "tests/test_pagination.py"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": "",
      "affects": [],
      "body": "`page` 从 1 开始，小于 1 返回 `400 INVALID_PAGE`；`page_size` 默认 20，小于 1 返回\n`400 INVALID_PAGE_SIZE`，大于 100 时截断为 100。`total` 是过滤后、分页前的记录总数，\n不是当前页条数。超出末页返回空 `items` 且 `total` 不变。",
      "source": "specs/order-query.md#L29",
      "revision": "34eb54553ba87ee71cc6c371d7d7e717292a90a85cc41757bbd52db97e60c112"
    }
